<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-RAIN DELAYS START AT ST GEORGE'S PARK.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN DELAYS START AT ST GEORGE'S PARK.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steady overnight rain, followed by persistent drizzle during the morning, delayed the start of the opening day of the four-day Supersport Series cricket match between Eastern Province and Western Province at St George's Park on Friday.</p>
</text>
